WEBVTT

00:11:58.255 --> 00:12:01.425
Because what mostly makes up that number

00:12:01.467 --> 00:12:03.302
is, like, a game recap,

00:12:03.302 --> 00:12:04.928
a quick highlight.

00:12:04.928 --> 00:12:07.514
We call these "one-and-dones."

00:12:07.890 --> 00:12:09.600
There is nothing to think about.

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.310
There's no follow-up.

00:12:11.977 --> 00:12:13.937
It is a “storyline” for a reason,

00:12:13.937 --> 00:12:16.648
because a "line" keeps going.

00:12:17.024 --> 00:12:18.192
(Laughter)

00:12:18.817 --> 00:12:21.236
A game recap is not a storyline.

00:12:22.279 --> 00:12:27.993
What drives interest in sports
are the heroes and the villains,

00:12:27.993 --> 00:12:29.703
and the "Were they paid too much?"

00:12:29.703 --> 00:12:31.914
and "Should that coach be fired?"